WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.469
Step 1. Open Purchase Deliveries.

1.2
00:00:02.469 --> 00:00:07.580
A purchase delivery records the goods a supplier brings to a store location.

1.3
00:00:07.580 --> 00:00:11.413
Select Services, open the service and the store location,

1.4
00:00:11.413 --> 00:00:20.160
then select Purchase Deliveries.

2.1
00:00:20.160 --> 00:00:25.238
Step 2. Start the delivery. Select Create Delivery.

3.1
00:00:25.238 --> 00:00:27.797
Step 3. Enter the delivery details.

3.2
00:00:27.797 --> 00:00:33.271
Enter a name, and select the vendor or distributor. The note and tags are optional.

3.3
00:00:33.271 --> 00:00:46.425
There is no destination field: Care uses the store location that you are in.

4.1
00:00:46.425 --> 00:00:49.886
Step 4. Create the delivery. Select Create.

4.2
00:00:49.886 --> 00:00:55.688
Care opens the new delivery with the status Draft, ready for its items.
